--TEST--
a class that is not the only declaration in its file is refused a new namespace, because only a file with one declaration can move with it — `rule:ide/a-type-moves-with-its-namespace`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

class La<|>bel
{
}

class Tag
{
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=Shop\Tools\Label
--EXPECT--
refused: `Shop\Label` is not the only declaration in its file. Move it to its own file first.
